<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<ol dir="auto">
<li>Adds the <code class="notranslate">filecheck</code> script from yari (refactored with the help of GPT-5 to use <code class="notranslate">yargs</code> and plain JavaScript).</li>
<li>Removes <code class="notranslate">@mdn/yari</code> from the <code class="notranslate">dependencies</code> in <code class="notranslate">package.json</code>.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto">Also:</p>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Adds <code class="notranslate">@mdn/core-dev</code> as code owner of the <code class="notranslate">filecheck</code> script.</li>
<li>Removes the deprecated <code class="notranslate">start:fred</code> and <code class="notranslate">start:legacy</code> scripts.</li>
<li>Updates the <code class="notranslate">up-to-date-check</code> script to check Fred instead of Yari.</li>
<li>Updates the <code class="notranslate">build</code> and <code class="notranslate">content</code> scripts to use rari directly (instead of <code class="notranslate">rari-build</code> and <code class="notranslate">rari-tool</code> provided by yari).</li>
<li>Removes an obsolete asset copy step from the <code class="notranslate">pr-test</code> workflow.</li>
<li>Adds the <code class="notranslate">filecheck</code> tests, rewritten for the Node-native test runner.</li>
<li>Rewrites the <code class="notranslate">frontmatter_linter</code> test to the Node-native test runner.</li>
<li>Removes the <code class="notranslate">jest</code> dependency in favor of the Node-native test runner.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">Yari is in the process of being archived, and the content repo is already using Fred by default <a href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40961" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/pull/40961/hovercard">since September 4, 2025</a>.</p>
